{"id":73609,"date":"2026-11-09T16:54:47","date_gmt":"2026-11-09T16:54:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73609"},"modified":"2026-11-09T17:56:32","modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T16:56:32","slug":"trilho-do-vinho-de-talha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-do-vinho-de-talha\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilho do Vinho de Talha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilho do Vinho de Talha 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilho do Vinho de Talha 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no feriado de <strong>1 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Ter\u00e7a-feira), com partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia de <strong>Vila de Frades<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vidigueira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Beja<\/strong>. O evento integra simultaneamente a 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da hist\u00f3rica Subida \u00e0 Ermida de Santo Ant\u00f3nio e \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vidigueira<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a Junta de Freguesia de Vila de Frades e a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa contempla quatro vertentes com partida no p\u00f3rtico junto \u00e0 Junta de Freguesia de Vila de Frades: o <strong>Trail Sprint (20 km)<\/strong> e o <strong>Mini Trail (10 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 10:00, bem como duas op\u00e7\u00f5es de <strong>Caminhada (10 km e 5 km)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 10:05, percorrendo vinhas, caminhos rurais e a subida \u00e0 Ermida de Santo Ant\u00f3nio na capital do Vinho de Talha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica unisexo, medalha finisher, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, seguro desportivo, transporte de ida e volta para duches nas Piscinas Municipais de Vidigueira e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio com anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255,